      "statusChangeID": "66ba4158474d2a577f76c7ce",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "interested",
      "value": "I'm going to be marking this as \"Interested\" for now. There are various workarounds that we could implement but fundamentally we're using the skeletal fidelity provided by the driver to determine the hand tracking mode. This is a bit of a new hardware/driver ecosystem that's coming together now and us adding lots of overrides and workarounds at this early stage while its forming may prevent issues from being noticed and fixed at a fundamental level. We'll continue to observe as the new ecosystem evolves and may introduce overrides and workarounds beyond the SteamVR spec if it turns out to be appropriate in the long run.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
